# Restricted calibration publication boundary.
#
# These files remain available in the local working tree for the audited
# calibration, but they must not enter a public commit. The publication gate
# under input/gcamdata/ai-data-center/provenance enforces the same boundary in
# CI, including against a forced add. Replace this block only together with a
# reviewed open-data profile and new manifests.
/input/gcamdata/ai-data-center/generation/ai_constants.py
